WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.389
Watch the cube placements.

00:00:03.389 --> 00:00:05.667
Last placement before the press.

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:08.222
The button is pressed.

00:00:08.222 --> 00:00:13.556
First placement after the press.

00:00:13.556 --> 00:00:22.500
Remember the two locations.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:34.850
Return the cube to its last location before the press.

00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:45.550
Return the cube to its first location after the press.
